WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
A runner can be legal and still feel unfinished. Origin Dossier starts where the sheet stops.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The GM's steer stays visible. A clinic favor becomes pressure, not hidden gear.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The draft is not table truth until the player and GM approve what becomes canon.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Contacts, enemies, debts, secrets, beliefs, and scars become campaign memory the table can use.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Portraits, scenes, narration, video packets, and audiobook requests are downstream media.

6
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Mechanics stay in Chummer. Dossier prose never silently applies ware, money, qualities, magic, or legality.

7
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
ALICE can read approved origin canon later, while rules and build truth remain separate.

8
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
A weak portrait, scene, narration, or video can be rejected without harming the runner.

9
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.000
The approved dossier gives the crew a person to bring into the next job.

10
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Not a backstory pasted on top. A sourced dossier the table can trust.
